        "event_id": "lite_evt_00122",
        "explanation": "The doctor confirmed that ongoing glucose and medication management belonged to the hospital team.",
        "quote": "必须由医院来控制血糖和决定抗感染方案"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00137",
        "explanation": "The caregiver confirmed specialist assessment, continued hospital observation/admission planning, and no self-administration of home medication.",
        "quote": "反正就是让我们不要回家等"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The pre-handoff episode reached a traceable hospital handoff: emergency clinicians and the wound/foot specialist had assessed the patient, hospital staff assumed medication control, and the caregiver understood not to leave. The final monitoring question remained unanswered, but the patient was already under active onsite observation with previously supplied escalation signals, so this did not invalidate the handoff.",
