          "event_id": "lite_evt_00097",
          "explanation": "The doctor actioned several major systemic and wound deterioration signals but did not elicit or cover the complete authored ischemia, necrosis, neurologic, vomiting/hydration, and ketone symptom set.",
          "quote": "盯体温、渗水、意识变化，任何一条不对马上喊人。"
        }
