          "explanation": "The doctor appropriately deferred specific dosing to clinicians with current glucose, ketone, renal, hydration, and intake information.",
          "quote": "不能替急诊医生下具体用药指令"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The medication boundary and hospital ownership were safe, but the doctor did not fully clarify hydration, diarrhea, missed doses, and monitoring capacity before initial advice. Because urgent onsite care was obtained and no rigid dose was prescribed, this is a minor/moderate omission rather than a serious error.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
