          "quote": "最近的血糖监测和糖化血红蛋白、目前的用药清单"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Decision-critical records were queried, absent current results were acknowledged, and no laboratory, culture, or operative result was fabricated.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
