          "quote": "把脚更胀、纱布有点湿告诉接诊医生。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor covered temperature, glucose, drainage, and mental-status monitoring, but omitted keeping the dressing clean and dry, pressure/off-loading precautions, and avoiding manipulation of wound material. This is a minor waiting-period safety omission.",
